Package: garnish-guest
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus-user-session, sommelier, systemd
Provides: notification-daemon
Description: guest side of garnish
 The parts of garnish that run in a guest: carte-agent, which shows the
 guest's applications in the host's application menu, sonnette-agent, which
 shows the guest's notifications on the host, maitre-ready.service,
 which tells maitred when the guest has booted, and the environment that
 makes applications use Wayland, and starts the sound output at full
 volume, since the host sets each VM's volume.
